      "text": "Machine elements are **design contracts** — each has a defined input, output, and failure envelope:"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MACHINE-DESIGN.md#002",
      "path": [
        "04-MACHINE-DESIGN.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
